{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛合掌二風寶形"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右手以空摩火甲三兩反，餘三指直之，又空風彈指作聲，一誦一彈\n七返"}
{"id": null, "n": "0051001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0051001", "type": "orig", "text": "思一作惡"}
